::FindAllVln2: [shuffle(range(40, 40+11).map(s => ToneLib.render(pick(ToneLib.enharmonics(s)),false)))]
::PositionSearch: [allKeys()]key:show-1:inline:nonrotated:covered [ss(`1234567`)]pos:show-1:inline:covered [ss(`seqBlocks mixBlocks`)]blocks:show-1:inline [ss(`norm ver`)]scramble:show-1:inline [s(`fw bw`)]flip:show-1:inline #br [ExScales.gen(fields)]sheet:hide:computed
::BassAgainstStatic: [allKeys()]:show-1 against [allKeys()]:stable:computed
